WEBVTT

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.090
Stella!

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:45.850
She's alive.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.840
She isn't as pale as she was before.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.510
You must be dizzy.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.370
Come here.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.360
It's not dead.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:20.820
Long time no see.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:22.740
Joseph.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.530
When did we last meet? At the graveyard?

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.120
I could never forget you after 
what you'd done to me.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.630
<i>He doesn't remember.</i>

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:39.590
You always cause me so much trouble.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.040
Well, it's fine.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.740
You accepted my deal, after all.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.420
You're the same as me.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:56.390
Your curse is as powerful as mine.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.360
I'm cursed to live on forever.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.780
You're cursed to die.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.820
So give me your left arm.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.290
It's my arm that you want?

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.420
Yeah.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.990
That part looks the most usable right now.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:25.340
I'll give you a part of me in exchange.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:29.880
That way, you'll have 
a body that can never die.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.760
I can't trust you.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:39.430
Are you saying you have another option?

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:41.900
You're doing it.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.410
Do I just need to give you my arm?

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:53.370
First, let's make sure my 
body doesn't reject it.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:01.650
There.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:03.260
Now it's your turn.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.010
What? Are you scared?

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.690
You might be freed from your curse.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.620
It's okay.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.650
You won't change into 
another form or anything.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.130
Even if I did...

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:24.780
I wouldn't care.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.540
Why are you so...

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.190
What?

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:35.850
Nothing. I was just thinking
about how I still hate you.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.120
I'll help you.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:02.510
There.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.890
Transplant complete.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:10.020
Don't worry, you won't 
die just from bleeding.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.570
It doesn't seem like my body's rejecting it.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:22.720
Your eyeball makes the world 
look bright and shiny.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.460
I envy you.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:35.110
We're the only people in this 
world who see what we do.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.760
I'll have your arm once 
the curse settles in.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:46.410
Don't worry. It'll all be 
done while you're asleep.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:49.480
I'm going to borrow the power 
that's left in your eye.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.460
What are you...

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:57.660
I told you. I hate you.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:00.510
So...

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.740
<i>What is this place?</i>

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.550
<i>I don't know...</i>

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:20.900
<i>No...</i>

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:22.970
<i>It's nostalgic.</i>

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.700
<i>I know this place.</i>

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.540
Sorry, Chise.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:35.910
<i>Mom?</i>

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.540
Welcome home, Mom!

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.200
Thanks for watching the house.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.840
It wasn't too scary, was it?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.080
Yeah, Fumiki was with me, 
so everything's okay.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.340
Okay.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:51.010
Fumiki's lucky he takes after his dad.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:57.130
<i>This is before my dad and 
little brother vanished.</i>

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.200
Fumiki's a good boy.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:03.430
Hey, I can change his diaper now!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:07.820
You're right.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.340
Thank you.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.650
You're a good girl, too, Chise.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:17.560
Mommy, Mommy, I want to help make dinner.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.000
Really?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.050
What should I have you do?

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.930
I'll do anything.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.250
<i>That's right.</i>

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:27.760
<i>She used to have a really happy smile.</i>

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.000
Welcome home, Dad!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:39.680
Just a sec.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.040
You're gonna get wet.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.760
Welcome home, Yuuki.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.390
You're home late.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:48.330
Hurry!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.670
Yeah.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.850
I'm home, Chise.

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:51.940
Welcome home!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.790
Hey! I can't walk!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:56.530
Hey.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.080
<i>I guess I took after my dad.</i>

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:09.790
Is work tough?

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.760
I have more night shifts now.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:16.810
I'm sorry. I wish I could work, too.

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.660
You already take care of things 
around the house, Chika.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.640
Besides, Chise's like you.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.760
She's got a frail body.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:27.220
I feel better with you around her.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.520
Thanks, Yuuki.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.040
<i>Frail body...</i>

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:34.530
<i>Mom was the same as me?</i>

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:19.070
<i>This is my memory.</i>

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:25.290
<i>He's keeping me in a dream 
so that I don't wake up.</i>

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.000
Car—

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.080
No.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.210
You aren't him.

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:40.300
I'm a fragment of him 
that's been chopped off.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:47.150
He's attached and assumed 
all kinds of things.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:52.780
Which is the real him, what 
he even was to begin with...

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.960
none of it is clear anymore.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:01.130
Why is he making me see 
all this stuff from my past?

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.570
Probably to upset you.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:09.180
That there is hurting you,
but it's also protecting you.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:13.970
It's the reason you're able 
to talk to something like me.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.250
You're...

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.030
You don't want to touch me.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.060
Not until you're ready.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.030
Ready?

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.310
It's okay, I'll calm him down.

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.150
Thanks.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:03.400
Dad, are you going somewhere?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.370
Chise, do you want to...

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:11.080
No, I'll be right back.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.200
Wait here.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:19.310
Well, good night.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.850
Come back soon.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.280
<i>Dad never...</i>

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:31.670
No!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.540
<i>...came back home.</i>

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:41.990
That's all you remember.

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:44.090
That door won't open.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:51.440
Yuuki?

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.040
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:57.920
<i>Ever since this day...</i>

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.460
Come on, again?

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.070
I'm sorry.

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.940
Something's odd lately.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:10.200
Ever since Hatori-san showed up, right?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.580
Want some help?

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:18.590
Welcome h—

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.960
What's wrong?

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:30.550
I was the one who said you can't be scared.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.580
I'm sorry.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.630
It'll be okay.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.580
<i>It'll be okay.</i>

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:44.840
<i>It'll be okay.</i>

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.460
<i>It'll be okay.</i>

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.640
Help!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.440
Help, Mom!

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.440
Get out!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.270
Now!

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:33.740
Hey, it's midnight! Shut up!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.110
<i>I have to protect her.</i>

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.020
<i>I have to protect her.</i>

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.990
<i>I have to be strong.</i>

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:46.720
That guy who was protecting
them isn't around lately.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.690
Poor thing. He must have gotten sick of her.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.320
An abandoned woman.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.460
An abandoned daughter.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:55.690
Pitiful and appetizing.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:12.400
Yes.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.320
I see.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:15.590
Yes.

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:17.550
I understand.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.670
<b>Popular job listings!</b>

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.230
It'll be okay.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.850
I have to protect her.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.010
It'll be okay.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.290
It'll be okay.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:39.820
I'll be okay on my own.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.390
It'll be okay.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:45.360
It would be so much easier 
for me without her.

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:48.270
That's crazy! That's crazy!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:05.490
<i>But, if she weren't here...</i>

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.930
I shouldn't...

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.600
have given birth to you.

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:48.500
I shouldn't have given birth to you.

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:52.800
M... om...

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.560
<i>What have I done?</i>

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.230
Mom?

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:27.010
I'm sorry, Chise.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.210
Please forgive me.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:39.170
To upset me?

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.380
To <i>upset</i> me?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.340
This is <i>really</i> upsetting.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:49.910
Mom...

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.330
I shouldn't have given birth to you.

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.340
It's your fault.

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:05.740
It's because your body is so weak.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.600
Why?

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.050
Why?

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:11.760
You should have died.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:17.310
Die, die, die, die, 
die, die, die... Die!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.040
Why didn't you finish me off, then?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:25.320
You aren't my real mom.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.360
You're the mom that exists inside of me.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:34.820
The mom that I created
after she strangled me.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.760
I'm glad I talked to Nevin.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:52.370
Angelica-san, Simon-san, Alice and Renfred,

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:56.270
Lindel-san, the people of the fairy world...

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:00.600
Ruth, Silky, Stella,

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:03.150
Elias...

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:07.670
I'm glad I got to meet all kinds of people.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:13.120
Without them, I would have 
died before I'd met you.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:18.990
Forgive me.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.630
Forgive me, Chise.

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:24.090
Forgive me.

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:29.030
You endured for my sake, didn't you?

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:35.140
You endured and endured, but in the end...

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.200
<i>You're free.</i>

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.220
I won't forgive you.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.480
I loved you, Mom.

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:01.130
I have lots of happy memories with you.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:06.370
And yet, ever since that day,
 I couldn't remember any of them.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:11.640
But thanks to you,

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:16.420
I met someone that I cared
for even more than myself.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:21.940
I thought he was strong, but he 
turned out to be pretty troubled.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:26.240
Yeah.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.400
So...

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.020
So...

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:42.540
Thanks for letting go of me that day.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.030
I won't forgive you.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:52.900
I won't forget you yet,

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:59.290
but I'm going to leave you and move on.

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.980
Are you ready?

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:28.580
What are you?

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.880
I'm what keeps one living on.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:36.280
The curse and blessing that 
was given for his sake.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:37.880
Joseph.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:39.910
Cartaphilus?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:46.170
They planted me in you, and 
you're trying to accept me.

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:52.490
So as long as you wish to 
live, I'll be your blessing.

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:59.480
Even if that means tearing at what consumes 
and protects you for all eternity.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:03.710
What do... What do you desire?

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:05.150
Me?

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.590
What's the price?

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:10.000
What you say sounds good only for me.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:16.540
There's one wish that I've heard many times.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:22.290
Can you grant that for me?

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:28.810
It looks like it's starting to set in.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.540
How vile.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.100
Just like me.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.350
Y-You're awake—

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:43.320
I'm going to do things the way you do.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:47.290
I don't know if I can grant you your wish.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:52.780
But I can hear you out, 
and try to do something.

00:21:57.410 --> 00:21:58.510
"Help me."

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:04.750
For centuries, for millennia,

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:09.220
they've been shouting, "Help me."

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:15.870
I don't know why you desire this.

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:19.970
Why, when you think as you 
do, you still do this.

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:21.440
Why you've done this.

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:24.020
So I'm going to find out.

00:23:55.940 --> 00:23:59.010
The girl tries to make 
sense of Joseph's truth.

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:05.330
Meanwhile, the mage, having lost the girl, 
loses his human form, and is forced to wander.

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:06.540
You saw?

00:24:06.780 --> 00:24:07.850
You saw me?

00:24:07.850 --> 00:24:09.340
My past?
